sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Rust coordinator
    participant S as Trusted supervisor
    participant M as Offline model worker
    participant C as Encrypted CAS
    participant O as Trusted oracle
    participant B as Trusted runner
    K->>S: Scoped TaskBundle + lease (mTLS)
    S->>M: Read-only task mount (no network)
    M-->>S: Write-only output scratch (patch/claim)
    S->>C: Seal transcripts, tool calls and patch
    S-->>K: TaskReceipt + output digest
    K->>O: Immutable candidate + trusted tests
    O-->>K: Signed OracleResult
    K->>B: Frozen benchmark request + exclusive lease
    B-->>K: Signed raw samples
    K->>S: Scoped filtered feedback capsule
    S->>M: New read-only feedback mount
